    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762970/extras/8c12192bf18cea7dca609eabb131af9c.poster.avif?t=1729529215\" width=598 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762970/extras/8c12192bf18cea7dca609eabb131af9c.webm?t=1729529215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762970/extras/8c12192bf18cea7dca609eabb131af9c.mp4?t=1729529215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose your build! Explore dozens of dynamic power-ups in this action packed multiplayer 2D shooter. Bite-sized roguelike action!<br><br>Lighting-fast shooting gameplay! Mix and match power-ups to create the perfect build - or try to counter your opponent. Dodge bullets, teleport across the map, shoot poison and shotguns and boomerangs to come out on top! The loser of each round gets a powerup, so don't fret if you get caught - just get right back into the fray a little bit stronger!<br><br><strong>Online Multiplayer required</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762970/extras/8c12192bf18cea7dca609eabb131af9c.poster.avif?t=1729529215\" width=598 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762970/extras/8c12192bf18cea7dca609eabb131af9c.webm?t=1729529215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2762970/extras/8c12192bf18cea7dca609eabb131af9c.mp4?t=1729529215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose your build! Explore dozens of dynamic power-ups in this action packed multiplayer 2D shooter. Bite-sized roguelike action!<br><br>Lighting-fast shooting gameplay! Mix and match power-ups to create the perfect build - or try to counter your opponent. Dodge bullets, teleport across the map, shoot poison and shotguns and boomerangs to come out on top! The loser of each round gets a powerup, so don't fret if you get caught - just get right back into the fray a little bit stronger!<br><br><strong>Online Multiplayer required</strong>",
